<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>A macro for the melee Twin Shadow Axes in CSN:Z. You must have the Twin Shadow Axes in your inventory.

- How to Use?
  1).Install the macro and bind it to any key. Set the operating mode to an option other than      "Run Once".
  2).Activate keyran and launch your CSN:Z. Open your inventory and set your buymenu bookmarks C to "Twin Shadow Axes" and bookmark V to "Dualsword Phantom Slayer".
  3).Join or create a room of Zombie Scenario mode. When you enter the game, open your buymenu and press C. Now you can press your bind key to use the macro.

- Notes
  1).You have to use this macro in buyzone becuz you can only open buymenu in buyzone, otherwise it will not work.
  2).The efficiency of macros depends on your network quality. If the macro doesnt work,it may be be that your network quality is not good.</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 32 1
Delay 0 ms
KeyUp 32 1
Delay 0 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 20 ms
KeyDown 5 1
Delay 0 ms
KeyUp 5 1
Delay 30 ms
KeyDown 25 1
Delay 0 ms
KeyDown 9 1
Delay 20 ms
KeyUp 25 1
Delay 0 ms
KeyUp 9 1
Delay 0 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 0 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Counter-Strike Nexon: Zombies</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>